{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frontline Protocol</strong> is a real-time strategy game with deckbuilding and auto-battler elements. You can expect a tactically dense card system. During each match, you have access to three selectable decks, rewarding specialization, deck planning, and player skill while allowing you to strategically control every frontline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether playing solo or in online co-op with up to three other players, every battle brings new challenges. You share resources, spawners, and buildings. Through your deck composition, you can focus on specific roles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Economy</strong> \u2013 Construct new buildings or upgrade existing ones to generate more resources for your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/f3779ddf59ab352928e483cb7e50898c.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/f3779ddf59ab352928e483cb7e50898c.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/f3779ddf59ab352928e483cb7e50898c.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Defense</strong> \u2013 Build new towers or upgrade existing ones to stabilize your frontlines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/290b2772926a31b5c79d7c3dc07fc3d1.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/290b2772926a31b5c79d7c3dc07fc3d1.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/290b2772926a31b5c79d7c3dc07fc3d1.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Support</strong> \u2013 Maintain battlefield awareness and react to the enemy to counter weaknesses in a targeted way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/4c0271dd78e33f68bbeadabfd8e80b39.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/4c0271dd78e33f68bbeadabfd8e80b39.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/4c0271dd78e33f68bbeadabfd8e80b39.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Offense</strong> \u2013 Deploy troops to destroy enemy towers and capture the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/e1f082e6a02255cdfdbef7edb567bae0.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/e1f082e6a02255cdfdbef7edb567bae0.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/e1f082e6a02255cdfdbef7edb567bae0.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Meta-Progression System</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you progress through the game, you earn Booster Credits, which can be used to purchase new <strong>booster packs</strong>. These contain <strong>new cards</strong>, temporary bonuses, and resources to further develop your decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/dfa5e71ae77d33238009444079971d1f.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/dfa5e71ae77d33238009444079971d1f.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/dfa5e71ae77d33238009444079971d1f.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cards</strong> can also be <strong>upgraded</strong>, permanently reducing their deployment cost - creating long-term strategic depth instead of short-term optimization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/5e0f02521b6e45ca4a680da08745d449.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/5e0f02521b6e45ca4a680da08745d449.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/5e0f02521b6e45ca4a680da08745d449.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With every level up, you receive a <strong>skill point</strong> that can be freely invested into <strong>passive bonuses</strong>, such as increased starting resources, a larger starting hand, or improved resource income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/da64ebdc59c7178ef4b69a6c14ac3c94.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/da64ebdc59c7178ef4b69a6c14ac3c94.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/da64ebdc59c7178ef4b69a6c14ac3c94.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock <strong>achievements</strong> to earn additional credits and open even <strong>more booster packs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/1dc7aad3a8d66d8246ee188ab985dcd6.avif?t=1771517118\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With <strong>over 300 cards</strong> for units, buildings, towers, and special actions, you have the freedom to discover and refine the <strong>playstyle</strong> that suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/04e94f000fb3728abdd0bdc7128426d3.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/04e94f000fb3728abdd0bdc7128426d3.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3288450?t=1771517118","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/174dfbeb2dd2005da1dc57673eecd8236cc9429e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771517118","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/6060d2d8c96a07603af9c0975b64ee5e8f576d0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771517118","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/6060d2d8c96a07603af9c0975b64ee5e8f576d0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771517118","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3851230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frontline Protocol</strong> is a real-time strategy game with deckbuilding and auto-battler elements. You can expect a tactically dense card system. During each match, you have access to three selectable decks, rewarding specialization, deck planning, and player skill while allowing you to strategically control every frontline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether playing solo or in online co-op with up to three other players, every battle brings new challenges. You share resources, spawners, and buildings. Through your deck composition, you can focus on specific roles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Economy</strong> \u2013 Construct new buildings or upgrade existing ones to generate more resources for your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/f3779ddf59ab352928e483cb7e50898c.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/f3779ddf59ab352928e483cb7e50898c.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/f3779ddf59ab352928e483cb7e50898c.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Defense</strong> \u2013 Build new towers or upgrade existing ones to stabilize your frontlines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/290b2772926a31b5c79d7c3dc07fc3d1.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/290b2772926a31b5c79d7c3dc07fc3d1.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/290b2772926a31b5c79d7c3dc07fc3d1.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Support</strong> \u2013 Maintain battlefield awareness and react to the enemy to counter weaknesses in a targeted way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/4c0271dd78e33f68bbeadabfd8e80b39.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/4c0271dd78e33f68bbeadabfd8e80b39.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/4c0271dd78e33f68bbeadabfd8e80b39.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Offense</strong> \u2013 Deploy troops to destroy enemy towers and capture the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/e1f082e6a02255cdfdbef7edb567bae0.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/e1f082e6a02255cdfdbef7edb567bae0.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/e1f082e6a02255cdfdbef7edb567bae0.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Meta-Progression System</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you progress through the game, you earn Booster Credits, which can be used to purchase new <strong>booster packs</strong>. These contain <strong>new cards</strong>, temporary bonuses, and resources to further develop your decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/dfa5e71ae77d33238009444079971d1f.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/dfa5e71ae77d33238009444079971d1f.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/dfa5e71ae77d33238009444079971d1f.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cards</strong> can also be <strong>upgraded</strong>, permanently reducing their deployment cost - creating long-term strategic depth instead of short-term optimization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/5e0f02521b6e45ca4a680da08745d449.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/5e0f02521b6e45ca4a680da08745d449.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/5e0f02521b6e45ca4a680da08745d449.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With every level up, you receive a <strong>skill point</strong> that can be freely invested into <strong>passive bonuses</strong>, such as increased starting resources, a larger starting hand, or improved resource income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/da64ebdc59c7178ef4b69a6c14ac3c94.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/da64ebdc59c7178ef4b69a6c14ac3c94.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/da64ebdc59c7178ef4b69a6c14ac3c94.mp4?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock <strong>achievements</strong> to earn additional credits and open even <strong>more booster packs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/1dc7aad3a8d66d8246ee188ab985dcd6.avif?t=1771517118\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With <strong>over 300 cards</strong> for units, buildings, towers, and special actions, you have the freedom to discover and refine the <strong>playstyle</strong> that suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/04e94f000fb3728abdd0bdc7128426d3.poster.avif?t=1771517118\" width=920 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/04e94f000fb3728abdd0bdc7128426d3.webm?t=1771517118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mythic Anvil"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"htt